---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — How Chinese Menu Handles Your Data"
  description="How Chinese Menu handles your data: privacy-respecting analytics, clipboard access only when you copy the order card, and how to reach us with policy questions."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
      This page explains the limited information this site collects.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand how visitors use the menu explorer. No personal information is sold or shared.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Clipboard access</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The point-to-order card uses your browser clipboard only when you click Copy card. The copied text is not sent to a server.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For questions about this policy, use the contact details on the domain registrar record.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
